    SuperTags, v2.xx Additional Lists Package by Dotoran of Frontiers!
============================================================================

    This archive contains over 100 additional tagline listings for use with
my SuperTags, v2.xx program.

    To add these additional lists into your system, unpack(unLZX) the
"lists.lzx" archive directly into your "SuperTags/" directory.  Numerous
additional taglists and index files will be created in your "TagData/"
directory, and your "TagLines" file will be replaced with an updated version
that contains references to ALL taglists in this archive, as well as the
Variety list which came in the initial "supertags.lzx" archive.

    No additional steps are neccessary before you start using these lists,
so feel free to explore and enjoy!

